    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Swer">Swer</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">On ælmihtiges Godes naman, ðu me behete hal 7 clæne þæt, þæt ðu me sealdest, 7 fulle ware wið æfterspræce, on ða gewitennesse, ðe unc ða mid wæs: N.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">[I swear] in the name of Almighty God [that] you vowed that [the sale] was honest and true, and what you sold me was proof against future claims as was witnessed [by another] in our presence: N.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Að gif man afindeð his æhtc, syððan he hit geboht hafeð, unhal. On ealmihtiges Godes naman, ðu me behete hal 7 clæne þæt, ðæt ðu me sealdest, 7 fulle ware wið æfterspræce , on ða gewitnesse, ðe unc ða mid wæs: N.</ab>
      </div>
